<title>UK: Copper near six-week low in AM ring.</title>
<headline>Copper near six-week low in AM ring.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Claws back slightly from late Tuesday's six-week lows in nervous LME ring trading. Downside pressure showing few signs of easing, targets support at $2,400 a tonne.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Down slightly but underpinned by stocks fall.</p>
<p>ZINC - Slips with copper. Targets levels below $1,390.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Breaks below $7,200, Inco talks loom.</p>
<p>OTHERS - Quiet.</p>
</text>
